  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I read the dev update, I seen they are adding an Irish Gaelic tag for your profile, I'd really appreciate a Scottish Gaelic (Gàidhlig na h-Alba) tag as well, Scottish Gaelic is a dying language as well and it'd promote more people to maybe look into it and know the difference when they are tagged on people's profiles.\n\nI'd really appreciate being able to distinguish between the two as they are separate languages, it'd mean a lot to the people who still speak this beautiful language.\n\nTapadh leat airson seo a leughadh. (Thank you for reading this.)",
